   RowBox[{"Diagram", "[", 
    RowBox[{"C", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"x", ",", " ", "c"}], "}"}], ",", " ", "b"}], "]"}]}], "\n", 
  "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[1]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"7d158143-4a7c-4bde-9a1d-c2b760e6fd0b"],

